n acidic and rich in cysteine; RT&#x02013;PCR=reverse transcription&#x02013;polymerase chain reaction.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote10"><label>a</label><p>Stage T2 or greater invasive tumours compared to stages T1 or less tumours.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote11"><label>b</label><p>High levels of SPARC protein were observed in most of the metastatic foci.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote12"><label>c</label><p>High in the stromal myofibroblasts of the tumour tissues.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote13"><label>d</label><p>Forced expression by endogenous or exogenous SPARC.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>